# Wave W17-Z (Lake Insight): calm pine — a bank snow fir in blue-greens under the densest snow of the three: the design’s SNOWFIR stand in tree register, tier on tier of blue-green under settled white, on calm turf (ground baked in). Lake Insight’s own tree — split from its twin Lake Gallant’s shore elm by season entire (fir over ice vs elm over open water) and from Route 217’s bench pine by density: this crown is a stand’s crown, that one stands alone.
